        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Look at the subjects in 2a. Whole subjects are underlined; simple subjects are italicized. Those simple subjects do not name the main characters (gold) in the story. Instead, they are actions expressed in abstract nouns, walk and jump:",
