            "block_content": "2a. Once upon a time,  $ \\underline{\\text{a walk through the woods}} $ was taking place on the part of Little Red Riding Hood,  $ \\underline{\\text{when the Wolf's jump out from behind a tree}} $ occurred, causing her fright.",
